{"text": "announcement", "etymologies": [{"etymologyHTML": "<p>By surface analysis, <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"en\">announce</i> +\u200e <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"en\">-ment</i>.\n</p>", "pos": [{"pos": "Noun", "definitions": [{"definition": "An act of announcing, or giving notice.\n", "quote": [], "relative": {}}, {"definition": "That which conveys what is announced.\n", "quote": [], "relative": {}}, {"definition": "The content which is announced.\n", "quote": [], "relative": {}}]}]}], "pronunciation": [["US", "/\u0259\u02c8na\u028ans.m\u025bnt/"]]}